# Gridz monorepo — source of truth & sync playbook

## What this is

Open framework for **cryptographically-attested profiles** (Grid = signed cells + root). Production app: **gridz.bio** (`examples/next-app`). Identity subjects stay `*.gridz.eth`; public URLs `*.gridz.bio`.

**Production chain: Base mainnet (`8453`)** — not Ethereum L1. Canonical addresses: `specs/deployments.md` (update there first, then mirror below).

| Item | Base production value |
|------|----------------------|
| GridzResolver proxy | `0x73c5e3944B780D4927c403d351A4F94875DC57B3` |
| EAS | `0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000021` |
| SchemaRegistry | `0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000020` |
| cell schema UID | `0x394d8e67b1470cbdb7fa6c7d15d15d295ca81d822b55267939751a8a686abb87` |
| Registrar | `0xEBE4ceb499Ad95DC1e5662E3a223Ec8cc0a555d9` |
| RPC | `https://base.publicnode.com` |
| EAS explorer | `https://base.easscan.org` |

Legacy L1 resolver `0x190a9c0D29bCca03efeA85dcDF8F4b283e32dc52` — do not point gridz.bio at it.

