## Principles (do not violate)

- **Spec first** — `specs/` is authoritative; SDKs follow specs
- **No custodied user keys** on server (registrar key is protocol infra only)
- **Sinks are projections** — signed attestation is truth
- **No mock data** in non-test source (`pnpm check:nomock`)
- **Minimal diffs** — match existing patterns; don't refactor unrelated code
- **Subjects** stay `alias.gridz.eth` even on Base; don't rename to `.base.eth` without explicit product decision
